{
  "title": "ArcCivs 0.1.18 one-time entrance preparation",
  "assumptions": [
    "Baseline0.1.17; only one-time entrance support/headroom changes. Up to1 placed DIRT per preparation, no item drops from clearing up to2 headroom blocks. Existing solid support is reused. No currency/XP reward is added.",
    "Low/base/high:1/2/4 active hours and1/2/4 explicit eligible placements or preparation requests per hour:1/4/16 requests per owner-day;1/10/16 owners. Assumptions, not observed activity or daily limits.",
    "0.1.17 free control barrels remain unchanged. Ordinary construction retains schematic material costs. Entrance DIRT is free and excluded from those requirements; mutation is persisted before application and a completed receipt is not regenerated by polling.",
    "Maximum new DIRT is1 per preparation. Deletion/refounding and later explicit upgrades can leave earlier filler; there is no lifetime or daily issuance cap. Extreme manual or multi-account request rate is not measured. Existing16-building concurrent limit is not treated as a lifetime cap.",
    "Single-replica168h read at generatedAt1792361582079 covers12781records67175operations32players. DIRT sales2392items2261.31Vault across5transactions/2players. Material selection complete. Historical realized average0.94536 is not a current price. Five-minute buckets are not player sessions.",
    "Live Spawn shop file Blocks.page2.items.55 read via RCNet f2c549c90fca3197904ad995f96892d88089dd3076097f31fade4271dc964172:DIRT buy6 sell1. Conditional indirect resale uses1Vault/item, full recovery/sale, no taxes; not measured ArcCivs income and not guaranteed payout. Do not add item units to currency.",
    "Direct Vault,tokens,XP delta0. Conditional all-sold Vault exposure1/4/16 per owner-day and7/280/1792 per network-week. Existing SELL active; future SELL-off/contract transition would remove this modeled shop redemption. No new DIRT contract is assumed.",
    "SourceCoverage unclassified135 Vault operations152587.99 absolute; tokens3operations9. Ledger admin grants and concentrated sales do not establish normal savings. No progression purchase price or saving-time change in this patch.",
    "Decision: grant the requested small filler without a new gameplay gate; exact-once journal,revalidation,bedrock/Lands/data preservation and no drops bound each accepted action. Verify partial-apply recovery and no periodic regeneration; source,delivery,activation,native-client evidence remain separate."
  ],
